  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TROSA Phase 2: Rivers, Rights and Resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Transboundary Rivers of  South Asia (TROSA) phase II is to improve cooperation in governing shared water resources, strengthening resilience to climate change of riparian communities in the transboundary Mahakali basin upscaling, building on and being specific, thorough, participatory of multi -stakeholders of the initiatives taken in TROSA phase I.</narrative>
  </description>
